<title>SRI LANKA: Richard Pieris Q1 net turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Richard Pieris Q1 net turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the three months ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				    Q1 96/97	    Q1 95/96</p>
<p>    Turnover		     95.09    vs	 59.74</p>
<p>    Net profit/loss   (loss)  0.64    vs	  1.83 (profit)</p>
<p>NOTE - Richard Pieris Exports Ltd, a subsidiary of Richard Pieris &amp; Co, manufactures and exports rubber moulded products.</p>
